// chriz-iwd-encounters 320: a raider or defender that never woke leaves four days
// after the raid's first visit, as the woken ones already do (KUATKREM); the base
// game left them until chapter 3. On top of the raid's asleep scripts.

IF
  OnCreation()
  Global("SPRITE_IS_DEADYXUNOMEI","GLOBAL",2)
  !GlobalTimerNotExpired("2100_ATTACK","GLOBAL")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    DestroySelf()
END
